Use the **nhsa-coding** skill to generate medical insurance codes.

## Output Format

```
主要诊断：[code]
其他诊断：[codes]
手术操作：[procedure_code]
```

## Notes

- Always verify codes with the MCP connector
- Never output codes from memory — errors are common
